 "notes": "Fig. 4 left panel (aFF~ coupling), extracted from vector paths of figures/moneyplot.pdf in the e-print. Paper's Lagrangian is (1/4)(1/Lambda) a F F~, identical normalisation to g_agamma, so g_agamma = 1/Lambda with no conversion. Curve reported is the paper's new LEP II exclusions: the new OPAL 2-gamma inclusive limit, flat at 1/Lambda = 1.28e-3 GeV^-1 (text states validity 50 MeV-8 GeV; the figure draws it to 10 GeV, right edge taken at 10 GeV), and the OPAL 3-gamma recast boundary from 20 to 100 GeV ((3.3-7.1)e-4 GeV^-1, jagged). No LEP limit exists between 10 and 20 GeV (consecutive points bridge the gap). The Pb-Pb UPC curves (1 and 10 nb^-1) are projections and excluded; the paper's approximate ATLAS 2-gamma/3-gamma recasts (10-60 GeV and >65 GeV) are not included since the LEP result is the paper's robust new limit. 95% CL (Appendix A). Axes calibrated from tick-mark positions; broken x-axis (log below 5 GeV, linear above) handled.",
